# oracle: min_style hftn on a six-atom chain with harmonic bonds and angles and a Lennard-Jones pair term (1-4 pairs scaled), every iteration printed (the first eight iterations: beyond them the rows differ from native only by rounding amplified by the finite-difference Hessian products, past 1e-8 from iteration 9)
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 5.4e-9, atoms 2.0e-7.
# oracle-inputs: w225cm_hftn_mol.data
units           real
atom_style      molecular
boundary        f f f
read_data       w225cm_hftn_mol.data
pair_style      lj/cut 4.0
pair_coeff      * * 0.1 3.0
special_bonds   lj 0.0 0.5 1.0
bond_style      harmonic
bond_coeff      1 300.0 1.5
angle_style     harmonic
angle_coeff     1 50.0 110.0
thermo          1
thermo_style    custom step pe fmax
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
min_style       hftn
minimize        1.0e-12 1.0e-10 8 3000
